OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'much-loved'
OL,4,Awoman hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of an 84-year-old woman who
OL,7,Fdied after being hit by a car in East
OL,8,FYorkshire have paid tribute to her,
OL,9,Fdescribing her as "much loved".
OL,11,FPedestrian Ruth Hurd was struck by a
OL,12,Fblue Volkswagen Polo at the junction of
OL,13,FCave Road and Brantingham Road in
OL,14,FEllerker, near Brough, at about 16:50
OL,15,FGMT on Monday, according to Humberside
OL,16,FPolice.
OL,18,FShe later died in hospital.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
