OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'much-loved'
OL,4,Awoman hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, her family said: "Ruth
OL,7,Fwas a much loved person who throughout
OL,8,Fher life loved walking and being
OL,9,Foutdoors. We cannot put into words how
OL,10,Fmuch Ruth will be missed by all who
OL,11,Fknew her."
